  "chapter": {
    "number": 81,
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "hebrew_subtitle",
        "content": [
          "(82) A Psalm for Asaph."
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 1,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "God stands in the assembly of gods; and in the midst of them will judge gods.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 2,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "How long will you⌃ judge unrighteously, and accept the persons of sinners? Pause.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 3,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Judge the orphan and poor:",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "noteId": 154
          },
          {
            "text": "do justice to the low and needy.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 4,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Rescue the needy, and deliver the poor out of the hand of the sinner.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 5,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "They know not, nor understand; they walk on in darkness: all the foundations of the earth shall be shaken.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 6,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "I have said, You⌃ are gods; and all of you children of the Most High.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 7,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "But you⌃ die as men, and fall as one of the princes.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 8,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Arise, O God, judge the earth: for you shall inherit all nations.",
            "poem": 1
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "footnotes": [
      {
        "noteId": 154,
        "caller": "+",
        "text": "Gr. justify.",
